  "solution": {
    "text": "Radius of smaller circle is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;units (given)<br /><br />Since, it is touching both the axes, so its centre is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/7_solu_2014_maths.jpg\" style=\"width: 170px; height: 142px;\" /><br /><br />The distance between their centers<br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>25</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>",
